# P12 W4 (docs/design/sdk.md 9, 13.2): Quadrus' Settings. A long MENU
# pauses (Resume, New Game, Settings, Exit; owner's controls 2026-10-24,
# a MENU tap is the hold slot); Settings pushes the SDK's list:
# "Start Level" 1 and "Ghost Piece" On. Start Level has ten values, so
# SELECT pushes their list (sdk.md 9.2), "1" selected as the stock value
# lists; the wheel and SELECT pick 2 and go back. SELECT on Ghost Piece
# (two values) turns it off in place; MENU comes back to the pause menu
# over the same game, now with no ghost under the piece; New Game starts
# at level 2.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-quadrus-settings.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh game (the simulator seeds from a fixed value)
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Quadrus
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 800
hold MENU 700        # the pause menu
wait 600
shot paused
wheel +2 300         # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot settings
key SELECT           # Start Level: its value list
wait 1200
shot levels
wheel +1 300         # 2
wait 400
key SELECT           # picks it and goes back
wait 1200
shot level_set
wheel +1 300
wait 400
key SELECT           # Ghost Piece: Off
wait 600
shot changed
key MENU             # back: the pause menu again
wait 1200
shot back
key SELECT           # Resume: no ghost now
wait 800
shot no_ghost
hold MENU 700
wait 600
wheel +1 300         # New Game
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot level_two
quit
